      "created_at": "2013-03-30T22:34:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>And remember, you don't reshuffle just because you ran out of cards in a deck, you reshuffle when you have to draw and there aren't enough cards to do it. It's a subtle distinction, but important.&nbsp;</p>",
