      "created_at": "2013-04-01T22:14:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>And as an addendum, cards which tell you to reveal cards from the top of the deck don't make you reshuffle - you just reveal what's there, and if what you're looking for isn't there then you stop.</p>",
